-- the library brush is a pen of the editor
chalky chalky chalky
-- the first stroke writes the copy after the colors block

2 1 true
true true true
[]
-- a second stroke adds no copy
1 
-- undo takes the stroke and the copy away in one step; redo brings both
1 0
0 6 true
1
-- the drawing's copy wins over a changed library brush
[] 1
[] 1 4
[] 1 40
-- a built-in pen is never copied
0 -1
